# Force LF line endings for every text file on checkout.
# The rpcd backend (root/usr/libexec/rpcd/luci.kmod-helper) is a shell script:
# with CRLF endings every command name gains a trailing \r (e.g. "json_dump\r")
# and is reported as "not found", so all ubus calls reply with empty objects.
* text=auto eol=lf
